# Settings ▸ Advanced ▸ "Keep Niche in the menu bar" (GitHub #231): ⌘Q closes the incognito window and
# every page and puts the browser window away, and Niche keeps running. New Window brings the window
# back with its tab, whose page loads again; the incognito window stays closed. The scenario's own
# quit at the end (niche://debug?quit=1, the menu bar item's Quit) still quits.
# promise: #231
budget rss=700 stalls50=10
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true, "showToolbar": false, "keepInMenuBar": true}
niche://open?url=${PAGE}?n=kept
expect-log loaded 127\.0\.0\.1 \(HTTP 200\)
niche://action/newIncognitoWindow
wait 2
niche://debug?browserWindows=before
expect-log browser windows before: count=2
niche://debug?quit=menu
wait 2
expect-log menu bar: quit keeps Niche in the menu bar
niche://debug?browserWindows=away
expect-log browser windows away: count=0
expect-log Niche browser windows away: kind=normal .*open=\S*n=kept page=0
reject-log Niche browser windows away: kind=incognito
niche://action/newWindow
wait 3
expect-log menu bar: browser windows back
niche://debug?browserWindows=back
expect-log browser windows back: count=1
expect-log Niche browser windows back: kind=normal .*open=\S*n=kept page=1
reject-log Niche browser windows back: kind=incognito
